IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`
IMPORT `sgta-i-rg5-radio`
IMPORT `sgta-i-rg5-amendments`

-- LAYER-1 TESTS for the five amending instruments of Rg 5 (S 707/2005, S 263/2006, S 461/2009, S 20/2011, S 100/2016) and the
-- additions to regs 65A and 78.  Both sides of every commencement date.  Expected values are written by hand from the amending text.

§ `S 707/2005, from 11 November 2005: regulation 16`

#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(1) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may by written notice, without compensation, suspend or cancel the spectrum right or part of it` (Date 10 11 2005) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(1) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may by written notice, without compensation, suspend or cancel the spectrum right or part of it` (Date 11 11 2005) TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(1) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may by written notice, without compensation, suspend or cancel the spectrum right or part of it` (Date 11 11 2005) FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(1) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may by written notice, without compensation, suspend or cancel the spectrum right or part of it` (Date 11 11 2005) FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(1) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may by written notice, without compensation, suspend or cancel the spectrum right or part of it` (Date 11 11 2005) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(2) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may by written notice suspend or cancel the spectrum right, or require a financial penalty, or both` (Date 10 11 2005) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(2) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may by written notice suspend or cancel the spectrum right, or require a financial penalty, or both` (Date 11 11 2005) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(3) and (4) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may give notice of the date the suspension or cancellation takes effect` (Date 11 11 2005) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(3) and (4) (from 11 November 2005): the Authority may give notice of the date the suspension or cancellation takes effect` (Date 10 11 2005) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(2)(ii): the most the financial penalty may be, in dollars, on the date` (Date 10 11 2005) 50000000 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(2)(ii): the most the financial penalty may be, in dollars, on the date` (Date 11 11 2005) 50000000 EQUALS JUST 1000000
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(2)(ii): the most the financial penalty may be, in dollars, on the date` (Date 31 3 2016) 50000000 EQUALS JUST 1000000
-- from 1 April 2016: the higher of 10% of annual turnover and $1 million.
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(2)(ii): the most the financial penalty may be, in dollars, on the date` (Date 1 4 2016) 50000000 EQUALS JUST 5000000
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(2)(ii): the most the financial penalty may be, in dollars, on the date` (Date 1 4 2016) 5000000 EQUALS JUST 1000000
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(2)(ii): the most the financial penalty may be, in dollars, on the date` (Date 1 4 2016) 10000000 EQUALS JUST 1000000
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 16(5) (from 11 November 2005): the penalty is a debt due to the Authority and the liability survives the spectrum right ceasing to be in force` (Date 11 11 2005) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Rg 5 reg 16(5) (from 11 November 2005): the penalty is a debt due to the Authority and the liability survives the spectrum right ceasing to be in force` (Date 10 11 2005) TRUE)

§ `S 263/2006, from 1 June 2006 (regs 6 and 10 from 1 May 2006)`

#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 19(3) (from 1 June 2006): the licence is valid for this many years unless cancelled, suspended or reduced` (Date 31 5 2006) TRUE 3 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 19(3) (from 1 June 2006): the licence is valid for this many years unless cancelled, suspended or reduced` (Date 1 6 2006) TRUE 3 EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 19(3) (from 1 June 2006): the licence is valid for this many years unless cancelled, suspended or reduced` (Date 1 6 2006) FALSE 3 EQUALS JUST 3
