§ `S 20/2011, from 21 January 2011: regulation 76`

#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 76: the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services that the regulation refers to` (Date 20 1 2011) EQUALS JUST "the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services 2000 (G.N. No. S 412/2000) issued by the Authority under section 26 of the Act"
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 76: the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services that the regulation refers to` (Date 21 1 2011) EQUALS JUST "the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services issued by the Authority under section 26(1) of the Act, as may be amended from time to time"
-- as made (S 114/2001) the words "2000 (G.N. No. S 412/2000)" are not in the regulation; the 2002 Revised Edition adds them
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 76: the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services that the regulation refers to` (Date 1 3 2001) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 76: the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services that the regulation refers to` (Date 2 3 2001) EQUALS JUST "the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services issued by the Authority under section 26 of the Act"
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 76: the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services that the regulation refers to` (Date 31 12 2002) EQUALS JUST "the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services issued by the Authority under section 26 of the Act"
#ASSERT `Rg 5 reg 76: the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services that the regulation refers to` (Date 1 1 2003) EQUALS JUST "the Code of Practice for Competition in the provision of Telecommunication Services 2000 (G.N. No. S 412/2000) issued by the Authority under section 26 of the Act"

